## 🎬 Animation Reference

### Standard Durations

```
SHORT:       150ms  - Quick feedback (button press)
MEDIUM:      300ms  - UI transitions
LONG:        500ms  - Screen transitions
EXTRA_LONG:  800ms  - Complex sequences
LOOP:       2000ms  - Background loops
```

### Easing Functions

```
EASE-OUT-CUBIC:     0.215, 0.61, 0.355, 1.0
  └─ Natural deceleration (fast start, slow end)

EASE-IN-CUBIC:      0.55, 0.055, 0.675, 0.19
  └─ Natural acceleration (slow start, fast end)

EASE-IN-OUT-CUBIC:  0.645, 0.045, 0.355, 1.0
  └─ Balanced acceleration/deceleration
```

### Animation Sequences

```
TAP BUTTON PRESS:
1. Scale: 1.0 → 0.95 (50ms)
2. Haptic: Light vibration
3. Particle: 8 coins burst outward
4. Scale Back: 0.95 → 1.0 (200ms spring)
5. Float: Combo number rises (300ms)

MONEY COUNTER UPDATE:
1. Character flip: Each digit animates (300ms total)
2. Color pulse: Optional gold flash (100ms)
3. Easing: Ease-out-cubic

LEVEL UP CELEBRATION:
1. Screen dim: Background fades (200ms)
2. Card rise: Level up card slides in (400ms)
3. Stars: Rotating icons (500ms)
4. Confetti: Multi-color particle burst

ZONE UNLOCK:
1. Screen shake: 3 vibrations (100ms each)
2. Glow: Yellow pulse (500ms)
3. Stars: Burst outward (400ms)
4. Sound: Celebratory chime
```

