## ✅ Design Consistency Checklist

When implementing components, ensure:

- ✅ Colors match palette exactly
- ✅ Font sizes follow typography scale
- ✅ Spacing uses defined scale (8dp grid)
- ✅ Buttons have minimum 48×48dp touch area
- ✅ Icons use consistent stroke width (1.5-2dp)
- ✅ Animations use standard durations
- ✅ Elevations follow system (0-16dp range)
- ✅ Corner radius consistent within category
- ✅ Text contrast ≥ 4.5:1 (WCAG AA)
- ✅ All text localized in 3 languages

